# Frame counts that are not a multiple of 4: the trailing samples are not part of this callback's peak but are kept in the 4-sample history and show up in the next one. Counts 0..7 shown.
init 48000 2
clock 1000000000
source a input
meter_new 0 0
meter_attach 0 a
meter_cb 0 add
meter_feed 0 a 0 1 5 ramp 0.1 0.1
meter_feed 0 a 0 1 3 const 0.9
meter_feed 0 a 0 1 1 const 0.2
meter_feed 0 a 0 1 2 const 0.3
meter_feed 0 a 0 1 4 const 0.05
meter_feed 0 a 0 1 7 const 0.05
meter_feed 0 a 0 1 0 const 0.05
